                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Overall, the puzzles are super simple, the game is very short and the narrator's annoyance doesn't click with me. It kind of is like \"There Is No Game\", but with a fraction of the content and humor. \nIf you like being yelled at and repeating the same puzzles over and over, this game is for you. It took me 3 hours to 100%, with the knowledge that the last achievement is missable. Otherwise, I would have needed to complete the game again from the start. \nFor 13€, I expected a bit more. If it's on sale, form your own opinion, but I would not recommend it.",
